pcbkit 2

// 54132-4062 (Molex): 40-contact 0.5 mm FFC connector for the Newhaven NHD-4.3-480272EF-ASXN 4.3"
// 480 x 272 24-bit RGB TFT (pins named as the panel's: backlight, R0-R7, G0-G7, B0-B7, CLK, DISP,
// HSYNC, VSYNC, DEN)
// Compiled from the part sheet `parts/NHD43_RGB_FPC40.json` (`parts.create`); status: checked.
// Datasheet: https://newhavendisplay.com/content/specs/NHD-4.3-480272EF-ASXN.pdf
// (NHD-4.3-480272EF-ASXN specification rev. 5 (2021-03-02): pin description, electrical
// characteristics (VDD 3.0-3.6 V, IDD 25 mA typ; backlight 25.6 V at 40 mA), timing (DCLK 9-15
// MHz), recommended connector Molex 54132-4062)
// Pins: Newhaven NHD-4.3-480272EF-ASXN specification, Pin Description table (1 LED-, 2 LED+, 3
// GND, 4 VDD, 5-12 R0-R7, 13-20 G0-G7, 21-28 B0-B7, 29 GND, 30 CLK, 31 DISP, 32 HSYNC, 33 VSYNC,
// 34 DEN, 35 NC, 36 GND, 37-40 NC)
// Footprint: as given
// This file may be used, changed and shared without conditions, with the board or alone.

// Note: The panel is a raw dot-clock display without a controller or frame memory: the host
// refreshes it continuously (about 60 Hz at a 9-15 MHz pixel clock) from a frame buffer.
// Note: With 16 colour lines (RGB565) tie R0-R2, G0-G1 and B0-B2 to ground.
// Note: The white LED backlight (12 LEDs) needs a constant-current boost to about 25.6 V at 40 mA:
// MT3608 with a 15 ohm sense resistor on FB (0.6 V).
// Note: DISP high (or open on this panel: default on) shows the image; low is standby.

/// 54132-4062 — 40-contact 0.5 mm FFC connector for the Newhaven NHD-4.3-480272EF-ASXN 4.3" 480 x
/// 272 24-bit RGB TFT (pins named as the panel's: backlight, R0-R7, G0-G7, B0-B7, CLK, DISP, HSYNC,
/// VSYNC, DEN)
